WEBVTT

00:12:29.204 --> 00:12:32.412
Give and Take with with a whole framework
to organize the world in terms of givers,

00:12:32.412 --> 00:12:35.621
takers and matters. And then I didn't
want to be constrained by

00:12:35.621 --> 00:12:38.037
a framework like that when I wrote
originals and I felt like

00:12:38.037 --> 00:12:41.829
I overcorrected and there wasn't enough
connective tissue between

00:12:41.829 --> 00:12:44.746
the different chapters. I felt like
I had a lot of interesting trees,

00:12:44.746 --> 00:12:46.162
but the forest was not clear enough.

00:12:46.162 --> 00:12:48.996
And so I decided when I was
writing Think again that

00:12:48.996 --> 00:12:51.412
I was going to be open to finding
an overarching framework,

00:12:51.412 --> 00:12:55.037
but I was not going to be attached to it.
And that that felt like the sweet spot.

00:12:55.037 --> 00:12:57.037
And about halfway through the writing,

00:12:57.329 --> 00:12:59.454
it hit me and I had to rewrite
the book from scratch.